  "id": "flutter",
  "term": "flutter",
  "definition": "Flutter is a type of vibration stimulation studied in touch perception, used to examine how people detect and combine sensory signals across the skin. In this context, flutter perception can show both improved detection when more than one digit is stimulated and reduced responding when an additional masking vibration is present.",
